  "content": "Tap into Your Healing PowerKarla Mans GirouxMay 31, 20251 min readUpdated: Aug 5, 2025Your body holds deep wisdom—and sometimes it needs a little guidance. Seven of the ten Radical Remission healing factors are mind-spirit related, reminding us that healing is not just physical. Trust your inner voice, seek the right support, and stay open. If one path doesn’t work, try another. Your healing is possible—I believe you will find it.From Radical Remisson Coach Shelly Keren - Tel Aviv, Israel I believe in the Mind-Body-Spirit connection and the body’s natural ability to heal. As a naturopath, my approach integrates nutrition, movement, and emotional wellbeing - many of which align with the healing factors of the Radical Remission research, which I connect to both personally and professionally.I love working with individuals and groups, taking an active role in their healing journey with compassion, empathy, and trust.Shelly focuses on nutrition, personalized bach remedies, reflexology, and mind-body therapies.Contact Shelly:shellytk@netvision.net.ilhttps://healthworkshops.co.il/Enjoy a 10% discount for Radical Remission workshops from Shelly (through the end of 2025)This information is for educational purposes only and is not intended as medical advice. Always consult your healthcare provider before making health-related decisions.507507 views00 commentsPost not marked as liked",
